window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>THE REAL WAR IS JUST BEGINNING . . . AND WE MAY ALREADY HAVE LOST</b><br> <br> Kate Morgan has had her memory wiped and has no idea of her true identity, her encounter with the monstrous Vu-Hak, or her relationship with humanity's presumed savior, Adam Benedict. But despite his apparent sacrifice, the portal has opened and the Vu-Hak are here on Earth in huge numbers. Invisible, wraith-like. And <i>searching for Kate</i>.<br> <br> Kate needs to rediscover the truth and recapture the threads of her life, and what is at stake. She takes charge of an around-the-world hunt for the one person who may be able to help stop the invasion; but no-one wants to believe her.</p>"; 
